  "content": "<p>Hidden in plain sight is a drama of life, death, and vermin.</p>\n    \n\n        <p>\n                                         By \n                                                                                                                                                    </p>\n                                    <p><a href=\"https://mashable.com/author/kristypuchko\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Kristy Puchko</a></p>\n            \n            \n            \n                    <p><img src=\"https://helios-i.mashable.com/imagery/defaults/fallback-thumbnail.fill.size_1600x900.1.png\" alt=\"Mashable Image\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"1600\" height=\"900\" /></p>\n                        <p>Kristy Puchko</p>\n                        \n                    \n                \n            <p>\n                Kristy Puchko is the Entertainment Editor at Mashable. Based in New York City, she's an established film critic and entertainment reporter who has traveled the world on assignment, covered a variety of film festivals, co-hosted movie-focused podcasts, and interviewed a wide array of performers and filmmakers. \n            </p>\n                            <p><a href=\"https://mashable.com/author/kristypuchko\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Read Full Bio</a>\n                    </p>\n                                <p>\n                                                                                                                             on <time datetime=\"Fri, 30 Oct 2026 22:00:00 +0000\">October 30, 2026</time>\n                                    </p>\n        <p>\n                            <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fmashable.com%2Fentertainment%2Fhaunted-hotel-opening-credit-hidden-story\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">\n    \n    Share on Facebook\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmashable.com%2Fentertainment%2Fhaunted-hotel-opening-credit-hidden-story&amp;text=%27Haunted+Hotel%27+has+a+hidden+story%2C+and+we+found+it\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">\n    \n    Share on Twitter\n</a>\n<a href=\"https://share.flipboard.com/bookmarklet/popout?v=2&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fmashable.com%2Fentertainment%2Fhaunted-hotel-opening-credit-hidden-story&amp;title=%27Haunted+Hotel%27+has+a+hidden+story%2C+and+we+found+it\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">\n    \n    Share on Flipboard\n</a>\n                    </p>\n    \n\n    \n                    <p>\n    All products featured here are independently selected by our editors and writers. If you buy something through links on our site, Mashable may earn an affiliate commission.\n</p>\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n                        <p><img src=\"https://helios-i.mashable.com/imagery/articles/04W9IWyd0M2KmsvgwihVx5x/hero-image.fill.size_1248x702.v1793388147.webp\" alt=\"The Freeling family of &quot;Haunted Hotel.&quot;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"1248\" height=\"702\" /></p><p>The Freeling family of \"Haunted Hotel.\"\n                \n                                    Credit: Netflix\n                            </p>\n                                \n\n            \n            \n            \n            \n                            \n                                                            <p>Spooky season is the perfect time to cozy up with <a href=\"https://mashable.com/article/haunted-hotel-review-netflix\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Haunted Hotel.</em></a><em> </em>The Netflix animated series blends horror with an animated family sitcom format that makes for fresh fun, and an addictive rewatch binge. (And, really, we've been revisiting Season 1 over and over since last Halloween.)</p><p>Now, with Season 3 announced ahead of this Halloween, we're sharing a secret we've found hidden in the Undervale. Sure, each episode focuses on the misadventures of the Freeling family, be it ghost uncle Nathan (Will Forte), his sister Katherine (Eliza Coupe), her chipper son Ben (Skyler Gisondo) and mischievous daughter Esther (Natalie Palamides), or their resident demon trapped in a boy's body, Abaddon (Jimmi Simpson). But beneath the surface of <em>Haunted Hotel, </em>another drama lurks — specifically under its floorboards. </p><p>In the opening title sequence, between when Esther defeats a vampire and Ben is chased out of the library by gremlins, there's a smaller story playing out between the floors of the hotel. You have to freeze-frame to see it. And even on a desktop watch, that can be tricky to do! So, we've done the hard bit for you.</p>\n                    \n                <hr />\n                <p><strong>You May Also Like</strong></p><hr />\n            \n        \n        \n\n                    <hr />\n            \n\n<p>After Season 1, some fans posted screenshots online, allowing others to dig into the curious war waged deep in the Undervale hotel. Now, with <a href=\"https://mashable.com/entertainment/haunted-hotel-season-2-trailer\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Season 2 out</a>, Mashable has pulled together screenshots from Seasons 1 and 2 in chronological order, so you can make out the stories for yourself. </p><p><em>Haunted Hotel</em>, Season 1, episode 1: \"Welcome to the Undervale\" </p>\n    <p><img src=\"https://helios-i.mashable.com/imagery/articles/04W9IWyd0M2KmsvgwihVx5x/images-1.fill.size_2000x655.v1793387005.png\" alt=\"&quot;Haunted Hotel&quot; season 1, episode 1 &quot;Welcome to the Undervale&quot; opening credits. \" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"2000\" height=\"655\" />\n\n\n            </p>\n            <p>\n            Credit: Netflix/screenshot\n        </p>\n    \n<p><em>Haunted Hotel</em>, Season 1, episode 2: \"Unfinished Business\"  </p>\n    <p><img src=\"https://helios-i.mashable.com/imagery/articles/04W9IWyd0M2KmsvgwihVx5x/images-2.fill.size_2000x765.v1793387005.png\" alt=\"&quot;Haunted Hotel&quot; season 1, episode 2 &quot;Unfinished Business&quot; opening credits. \" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"2000\" height=\"765\" />\n\n\n            </p>\n            <p>\n            Credit: Netflix\n        </p>\n    \n<p><em>Haunted Hotel</em>, Season 1, episode 3: \"Randy Slasher\"</p>\n    <p><img src=\"https://helios-i.mashable.com/imagery/articles/04W9IWyd0M2KmsvgwihVx5x/images-3.fill.size_2000x660.v1793387005.png\" alt=\"&quot;Haunted Hotel&quot; season 1, episode 3 &quot;Randy Slasher&quot; opening credits. \" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"2000\" height=\"660\" />\n\n\n            </p>\n            <p>\n            Credit: Netflix\n        </p>\n    \n<p><em>Haunted Hotel,</em> Season 1, episode 4: \"How to Train Your Demon\" </p>\n    <p><img src=\"https://helios-i.mashable.com/imagery/articles/04W9IWyd0M2KmsvgwihVx5x/images-4.fill.size_2000x778.v1793387005.png\" alt=\"&quot;Haunted Hotel&quot; season 1, episode 4 &quot;How to Train Your Demon&quot; opening credits. \" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"2000\" height=\"778\" />\n\n\n            </p>\n            <p>\n            Credit: Netflix\n        </p>\n    \n<p><em>Haunted Hotel</em>, Season 1, episode 5: \"Rollyfluffs\"</p>\n    <p><img src=\"https://helios-i.mashable.com/imagery/articles/04W9IWyd0M2KmsvgwihVx5x/images-5.fill.size_2000x952.v1793387005.png\" alt=\"&quot;Haunted Hotel&quot; season 1, episode 5 &quot;Rollyfluffs&quot; opening credits. \" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"2000\" height=\"952\" />\n\n\n            </p>\n            <p>\n            Credit: Netflix\n        </p>\n    \n<p><em>Haunted Hotel</em>, Season 1, episode 6: \"Ghost Hunters!\" </p>\n    