\"The Acolytes of Abaddon\" </p>\n    <p><img src=\"https://helios-i.mashable.com/imagery/articles/04W9IWyd0M2KmsvgwihVx5x/images-10.fill.size_2000x789.v1793387006.png\" alt=\"&quot;Haunted Hotel&quot; season 1, episode 10 &quot;The Acolytes of Abaddon&quot; opening credits. \" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"2000\" height=\"789\" />\n\n\n            </p>\n            <p>\n            Credit: Netflix\n        </p>\n    \n<p>Hey, bud. You okay? Sorry about that last one. I assure you, Season 2's has a happier ending. Here it is. </p><p><em>Haunted Hotel</em>, Season 2, episode 1: \"Ooze\" </p>\n    <p><img src=\"https://helios-i.mashable.com/imagery/articles/04W9IWyd0M2KmsvgwihVx5x/images-11.fill.size_2000x698.v1793387006.png\" alt=\"&quot;Haunted Hotel&quot; season 2, episode 1 &quot;Ooze&quot; opening credits. \" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"2000\" height=\"698\" />\n\n\n            </p>\n            <p>\n            Credit: Netflix\n        </p>\n    \n<p><em>Haunted Hotel</em>, Season 2, episode 2: \"Dinner Party\" </p>\n    <p><img src=\"https://helios-i.mashable.com/imagery/articles/04W9IWyd0M2KmsvgwihVx5x/images-12.fill.size_2000x689.v1793387006.png\" alt=\"&quot;Haunted Hotel&quot; season 2, episode 2 &quot;Dinner Party&quot; opening credits. \" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"2000\" height=\"689\" />\n\n\n            </p>\n            <p>\n            Credit: Netflix\n        </p>\n    \n<p><em>Haunted Hotel</em>, Season 2, episode 3: \"The Witch\"</p>\n    <p><img src=\"https://helios-i.mashable.com/imagery/articles/04W9IWyd0M2KmsvgwihVx5x/images-13.fill.size_2000x657.v1793387006.png\" alt=\"&quot;Haunted Hotel&quot; season 2, episode 3 &quot;The Witch&quot; opening credits. \" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"2000\" height=\"657\" />\n\n\n            </p>\n            <p>\n            Credit: Netflix\n        </p>\n    \n<p><em>Haunted Hotel</em>, Season 2, episode 4: \"Ghost Day Out\" </p>\n    <p><img src=\"https://helios-i.mashable.com/imagery/articles/04W9IWyd0M2KmsvgwihVx5x/images-14.fill.size_2000x675.v1793387006.png\" alt=\"&quot;Haunted Hotel&quot; season 2, episode 4 &quot;Ghost Day Out&quot; opening credits. \" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"2000\" height=\"675\" />\n\n\n            </p>\n            <p>\n            Credit: Netflix\n        </p>\n    \n<p><em>Haunted Hotel</em>, Season 2, episode 5: \"Astral Esther\" </p>\n    <p><img src=\"https://helios-i.mashable.com/imagery/articles/04W9IWyd0M2KmsvgwihVx5x/images-15.fill.size_2000x624.v1793387006.png\" alt=\"&quot;Haunted Hotel&quot; season 2, episode 5 &quot;Astral Esther&quot; opening credits. \" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"2000\" height=\"624\" />\n\n\n            </p>\n            <p>\n            Credit: Netflix\n        </p>\n    \n<p><em>Haunted Hotel</em>, Season 2, episode 6: \"Dante Crowe\"</p>\n    <p><img src=\"https://helios-i.mashable.com/imagery/articles/04W9IWyd0M2KmsvgwihVx5x/images-16.fill.size_2000x654.v1793387006.png\" alt=\"&quot;Haunted Hotel&quot; season 2, episode 6 &quot;Dante Crowe opening credits.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"2000\" height=\"654\" />\n\n\n            </p>\n            <p>\n            Credit: Netflix\n        </p>\n    \n<p><em>Haunted Hotel</em>, Season 2, episode 7: \"The Concierge\" </p>\n    <p><img src=\"https://helios-i.mashable.com/imagery/articles/04W9IWyd0M2KmsvgwihVx5x/images-17.fill.size_2000x661.v1793387006.png\" alt=\"&quot;Haunted Hotel&quot; season 2, episode 7 &quot;The Concierge&quot; opening credits. \" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"2000\" height=\"661\" />\n\n\n            </p>\n            <p>\n            Credit: Netflix\n        </p>\n    \n<p><em>Haunted Hotel</em>, Season 2, episode 8: \"The Visit\"</p>\n    <p><img src=\"https://helios-i.mashable.com/imagery/articles/04W9IWyd0M2KmsvgwihVx5x/images-18.fill.size_2000x755.v1793387006.png\" alt=\"&quot;Haunted Hotel&quot; season 2, episode 8 &quot;The Visit&quot; opening credits. \" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"2000\" height=\"755\" />\n\n\n            </p>\n            <p>\n            Credit: Netflix\n        </p>\n    \n<p>What will <em>Haunted House </em>creator Matt Roller have in store for season 3 (above and below the floorboards)? We can't wait to find out. </p><p><a href=\"https://zdcs.link/QP4Pdj?pageview_type=Standard&amp;template=article&amp;module=content_body&amp;element=offer&amp;item=text-link&amp;element_label=Haunted%20Hotel%20is%20now%20streaming%20on%20Netflix.&amp;object_type=article&amp;object_uuid=04W9IWyd0M2KmsvgwihVx5x&amp;short_url=QP4Pdj&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmashable.com%2Fentertainment%2Fhaunted-hotel-opening-credit-hidden-story\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><em>Haunted Hotel </em>is now streaming on Netflix. </a></p>\n            <p>Recommended deals for you</p>\n                            <p>\n                    <a href=\"https://cc.mashable.com/v1/otc/03bCs1jQxEftXGkZ7A6Km1e?merchant=05lFS8Mj6UsuRWTQ8dMGNWQ&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.hbomax.com%2F&amp;template=article&amp;module=offer-group&amp;element=offer-group&amp;item=offer-title&amp;position=1&amp;element_label=HBO+Max&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmashable.com%2Fentertainment%2Fhaunted-hotel-opening-credit-hidden-story&amp;group_uuid=04yL4HzXrqo8kEC6mvIdFTu&amp;product_uuid=067dkU37r39nz7VizQlxApi&amp;object_type=article&amp;object_uuid=04W9IWyd0M2KmsvgwihVx5x\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">\n    HBO Max\n</a>\n                                             —\n                    <strong>top pick for premium content</strong>\n                    \n                    \n                            